From 6916681e7c5393e9289b5152651723872bf14870 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: facetimehd downstream <facetimehd-downstream@localhost>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 01/21] driver: tidy without changing behaviour

Mechanical cleanup ahead of the functional changes: replace
__attribute__((packed)) with __packed, strcpy() with strscpy() and
__FUNCTION__ with __func__; make the file and ioctl operation tables
const; sleep instead of busy-waiting with mdelay() in paths that may
sleep; drop includes, declarations and structures nothing uses; fix
indentation; and give fthd_buffer.h and fthd_isp.h the includes and
forward declarations they need to stand on their own.
---
 fthd_buffer.c | 12 ++----------
 fthd_buffer.h | 14 ++++++++++----
 fthd_drv.c    |  8 ++------
 fthd_isp.c    | 21 ++++++++++-----------
 fthd_isp.h    | 17 ++++++++++++-----
 fthd_v4l2.c   | 22 +++++++++-------------
 6 files changed, 45 insertions(+), 49 deletions(-)

